{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2007_CyMO-22.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/b/ba/2007_CyMO-22.PNG/200px-2007_CyMO-22.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"276\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/b/ba/2007_CyMO-22.PNG/300px-2007_CyMO-22.PNG 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/b/ba/2007_CyMO-22.PNG/400px-2007_CyMO-22.PNG 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>In the figure, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is an orthogonal trapezium with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dcff3a51578515c8074ab704dc64bb5e86cc06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A= \\angle D=90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"131\" height=\"15\" /> and bases <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/0/f80e67527934e0557de487e6fdc23ea439b269b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = a$\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/8/dc806758379c4e6debede13929d41c4aa29b8895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DC = 2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" /> . If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/1/411715d5b37c2d49bb370356b96632cad4fd8a33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = 3a$\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of the side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e73bc78b745edf7fe1e55dbfc3d914190faf5015.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> equals to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/2/04264ce21c1eeffd36e49b36a8f8aceb1ff2bb3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } \\frac{3a}{2}\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } \\frac{3a}{\\sqrt{2}}\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\frac{5a}{2}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } \\frac{3a}{\\sqrt{3}}\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"417\" height=\"42\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />. The length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbcfabd65745f2b759dea1840f9a0753b2f992e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MN$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is the average of the bases, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/0/280f098fb0c7453d15c1220fa8b74a8f8dac0292.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3a}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"21\" height=\"37\" />. The length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/a/9aafc7e3cc1eafce5e16d3a45250eeda7b1a6526.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AN$\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" /> is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/0/280f098fb0c7453d15c1220fa8b74a8f8dac0292.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3a}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"21\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/a/90aa302feed3983e7156a34b821ad877642919b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AMN$\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" /> is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/2/22231a5cdd4fe05a11f4b577e3b81221f3017a85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45-45-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"98\" height=\"13\" /> triangle, the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e73bc78b745edf7fe1e55dbfc3d914190faf5015.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/5/e45445e9e00cd272e9f86f9ff62f279ea88d4422.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3a}{\\sqrt{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"26\" height=\"42\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/d/65d6070ef440d6b07d7bee9ee024465bf5ef34a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{B}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<t